   "prefix": "* ",
   "source": "[Declare the new state of the Pods](#updating-a-deployment) by updating the PodTemplateSpec of the Deployment. A new ReplicaSet is created, and the Deployment gradually scales it up while scaling down the old ReplicaSet, ensuring Pods are replaced at a controlled rate. Each new ReplicaSet updates the revision of the Deployment.",
