   "seq": 16,
   "blockType": "list_item",
   "level": 1,
   "prefix": "* ",
   "source": "A Deployment named `nginx-deployment` is created, indicated by the\n  `.metadata.name` field. This name will become the basis for the ReplicaSets\n  and Pods which are created later. See [Writing a Deployment Spec](#writing-a-deployment-spec)\n  for more details.",
