  {
   "seq": 18,
   "blockType": "list_item",
   "level": 1,
   "prefix": "* ",
   "source": "The `.spec.selector` field defines how the created ReplicaSet finds which Pods to manage.\n  In this case, you select a label that is defined in the Pod template (`app: nginx`).\n  However, more sophisticated selection rules are possible,\n  as long as the Pod template itself satisfies the rule.",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 2,
   "target": "`.spec.selector` 字段定义创建的 ReplicaSet 如何查找要管理的 Pod。\n  在此例中，你选择 Pod 模板中定义的标签（`app: nginx`）。\n  但是，也可以使用更复杂的选择规则，\n  只要 Pod 模板本身满足该规则即可。",
   "status": "DONE",
   "reviewScore": null,
   "reviewRounds": 0,
   "compliance": [
    {
