   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "Do not overlap labels or selectors with other controllers (including other Deployments and StatefulSets). Kubernetes doesn't stop you from overlapping, and if multiple controllers have overlapping selectors those controllers might conflict and behave unexpectedly.",
